35,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"The audit data is concerning. Hardware requires outside appraisal, adding six weeks.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,Recruiters can't place field crews quickly. That's a red flag for ops-heavy models.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shizue,,Retention is key. The practice software kept nine of ten accounts.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,Our credit line ignores subscription contracts. That limits our leverage.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
