43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"If we can't borrow against subscriptions, we need cash-flow positive assets.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shion,,The bank tool never missed a release. That's a strong signal.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,The software ones only report their own figures. That's a risk.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,The advisers on the bench are idle. We have too many software seats.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shizue,,The write-off ran its own premises. That's a cautionary tale.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,The reserve accounts show follow-on money at twice the modelled rate.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shion,,The device holding lost five months to a controller shortage.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
